              "type": "review",
              "difficulty": "medium",
              "timeLimit": 60,
              "stem": "Sketch the graph of the function \\(y=\\tan^{-1}\\!\\left(\\frac{x-2}{2}\\right)\\), showing clearly the intercepts on the axes and the equations of the asymptotes.",
              "hint": "Find the intercepts by setting \\(x=0\\) and \\(y=0\\); the horizontal asymptotes remain \\(y=\\pm\\frac\\pi2\\).",
              "steps": [
