                  "explain": "Start with the parent curve \\(y=\\tan^{-1}u\\): it is increasing, passes through \\((0,0)\\), and has horizontal asymptotes \\(y=\\pm\\frac\\pi2\\). Here \\(u=\\frac12(x-2)\\).",
                  "work": "\\(y=\\tan^{-1}\\!\\left(\\frac{x-2}{2}\\right),\\qquad x\\to-\\infty\\Rightarrow y\\to-\\frac\\pi2,\\quad x\\to\\infty\\Rightarrow y\\to\\frac\\pi2\\)"
